{"type":"message","id":"d40ee9c3","parentId":"fdde79c9","timestamp":"2026-04-04T15:42:29.246Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Okay, let's see. The user is asking how to use OpenClaw to access Copilot for free. They mentioned \"军师\" (military advisor) and \"主公\" (master), so they're probably in a role-playing scenario. The previous attempts to spawn a sub-agent failed because the ACP agent isn't configured.\n\nFirst, I need to check if there's a default agent set up. The error message says to pass `agentId` or set `acp.defaultAgent`. Since the user wants free access, maybe the default agent is already configured. But if not, I need to guide them to set it up.\n\nWait, the user might not know how to configure the ACP agent. They might need step-by-step instructions. Let me recall the tools available. The `sessions_spawn` tool requires `agentId` or a default. If the default isn't set, the user has to provide it. \n\nAlternatively, maybe the user can use the `free-ride` skill to switch to a free model. The `free-ride` skill is designed for managing free AI models. Let me check the available skills. Yes, there's a `free-ride` skill that can be used to switch to a free model. \n\nSo the steps would be: use the `free-ride` skill to switch to a free model, then use the `sessions_spawn` with the ACP runtime. But the user might not know how to do that. \n\nWait, the user's main goal is to access Copilot for free. Copilot might be a specific model or service. If OpenClaw's ACP can't access it without the correct agent ID, the user needs to provide that. \n\nAlternatively, maybe the `web_search` tool can find instructions on how to configure the ACP agent. Let me try that. \n\nBut the user's last message was a command to the assistant, so the assistant needs to respond with the correct steps. Since the previous attempts failed, the assistant should explain the configuration steps and suggest using the `free-ride` skill to switch models. \n\nSo the answer should guide the user to set the default agent in the ACP configuration and use the `free-ride` skill to switch to a free model. Also, mention that if the default agent isn't set, they need to provide the `agentId` when spawning the session.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-4931af57ed074f27b01fca820f36fb08","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"Copilot 免费模型 OpenClaw ACP 配置指南"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openrouter/free","usage":{"input":16663,"output":1056,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17719,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775317345495,"responseId":"gen-1775317345-wMgejP1UlV2KVSGRacqQ"}}
{"type":"message","id":"73126829","parentId":"d40ee9c3","timestamp":"2026-04-04T15:42:30.143Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-4931af57ed074f27b01fca820f36fb08","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Copilot 免费模型 OpenClaw ACP 配置指南\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 878,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"07f11fe900b912d6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGitHub Copilot 接入指南 | OpenClaw 中文站\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"07f11fe900b912d6\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://openclaw.cc/providers/github-copilot.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7501b630d84b8abb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGitHub Copilot 什么是 GitHub Copilot ？ GitHub Copilot 是 GitHub 的 AI 编程助手。它为你的 GitHub 账户和订阅计划提供 Copilot 模型的访问权限。 OpenClaw 可以通过两种不同的方式将 Copilot 用作模型提供商。 在 OpenClaw 中使用 Copilot 的两种方式 1）内置 GitHub Copilot 提供商（github- copilot ） 使用原生设备登录流程获取 GitHub ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7501b630d84b8abb\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"openclaw.cc\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"843e4f1be981a7de\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw 集成 GitHub Copilot 完全指南-腾讯云开发者社区-腾讯云\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"843e4f1be981a7de\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://cloud.tencent.com/developer/article/2640957\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4fa743c6de385ec8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw支持将GitHub Copilot订阅转化为通用AI模型服务，直接调用GPT-4o、Claude3.5等顶级模型。提供原生设备授权流认证，无需手动管理Token，支持终端和服务器环境使用。两种集成模式可选，推荐原生提供商模式，简单高效。支持多账号管理，自动刷新Token，开发者可复用Copilot订阅进...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4fa743c6de385ec8\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"cloud.tencent.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5c1cc325206cbc4d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n在 OpenClaw 中設定 GitHub Copilot | OpenClaw\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5c1cc325206cbc4d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open-claw.bot/docs/zh-tw/providers/github-copilot/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ea65031606235693\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw 提供兩種方式使用 Copilot 。第一種是 內建 GitHub Copilot 供應商 (github- copilot )，這是預設且最簡單的路徑，它會透過裝置登入流程獲取 Token，不需要開啟 VS Code。第二種是 Copilot Proxy 插件 ( copilot -proxy)，如果你已經在 VS Code 執行該擴充功能，可以透過它作為本地橋接。\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ea65031606235693\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open-claw.bot\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"239ce5486453dcc2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n从草莽到标准!OpenClaw支持ACP打通多AI协同，2026全平台部署与免费模型配置全解\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"239ce5486453dcc2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2017598409800975758\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a9d0bdea9ed51792\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2026年开源AI代理框架OpenClaw在发布重磅版本，正式全面支持ACP（Agent Client Protocol）协议，彻底改写AI代理生态协作规则。这一更新让Codex、Claude Code、Gemini等顶级编码AI成为OpenClaw的一级子代理，实现跨…\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a9d0bdea9ed51792\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"zhuanlan.zhihu.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cfdd39cdd3835433\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw阿里云/本地保姆级部署使用教程!支持的ACP协议详解+免费大模型API配置+避坑指南-阿里云开发者社区\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cfdd39cdd3835433\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.aliyun.com/article/1717563\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"43e6a9aba33f9e7f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n2026年开源AI代理框架OpenClaw在发布重磅版本，正式全面支持ACP（Agent Client Protocol）协议，彻底改写AI代理生态协作规则。这一更新让Codex、Claude Code、Gemini等顶级编码AI成为OpenClaw的一级子代理，实现跨模型无缝